      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <div>
          <p>Pre-888 contract executed between PGE and the Bonneville Power Administration concerning the exchange of transmission services over agreed-upon facilities. The contract is evergreen.<br /></p>
